&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine" style="height: auto; line-height: inherit; cursor: text; overflow: hidden; white-space: pre-wrap; padding-right: 10px;"&gt;Snyder, Christopehr M., Alternate Representative, US Southeastern&lt;/div&gt;
