        <p>Fuel quantities requiring an allocation are assigned to the rate categories on the basis of the stated fuel rates as referenced in Order No. 710-C, at paragraph 9.&#160; Specifically, within each functional category, the fuel quantities in lines 8 &#8211; 30 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Shipper Supplied quantities in lines 1 - 7 for each rate category to the total Shipper Supplied quantity for such functional category.</p>
