        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">ASC 980-710-25, "Accounting for the Effects of Certain Types of Regulation" contains discussion of the regulatory accounting implications of recording accrued vacation under ASC 710-10-2.</span>
